    "body": "Thanks for the pull request. Only a couple things before I can merge it.\r\n\r\n1. Please amend the commit message according to [meta/COMMITTING.md](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/COMMITTING.md). In particular, the first line should probably be marked as \"Editorial\" (which lets us avoid many of the usual checks) and be written in the imperative. I can do this when merging it need be.\r\n2. You need to be covered by an appropriate [participation agreement](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#participation-agreement) which applies to at least the URL workstream.",
